  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Curly-B Regression Tests\n\nValidate the trimmed curly-B path against exact low-level coefficients and stable golden hashes.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
  "value": "termList[expr_] := If[Head[expr] === Plus, List @@ expr, {expr}];\nnormalizeGeneratedSymbols[expr_] := Module[{symbols, groups, rules},\n  symbols = DeleteDuplicates @ Cases[\n    HoldComplete[expr],\n    s_Symbol /; StringMatchQ[SymbolName[Unevaluated[s]], ___ ~~ \"$\" ~~ DigitCharacter ..] :> Unevaluated[s],\n    Infinity\n  ];\n  groups = KeySort[GroupBy[symbols, StringReplace[SymbolName[#], \"$\" ~~ DigitCharacter .. -> \"\"] &]];\n  rules = Flatten @ KeyValueMap[\n    Function[{base, syms},\n      MapIndexed[\n        HoldPattern[#1] :> Symbol[Context[#1] <> base <> \"$\" <> ToString[First[#2]]] &,\n        SortBy[syms, SymbolName]\n      ]\n    ],\n    groups\n  ];\n  expr /. rules\n];\ntermHash[expr_] := IntegerString[Hash[ToString[InputForm[Sort[ToString[InputForm[#]] & /@ termList[normalizeGeneratedSymbols[Expand[expr]]]]], CharacterEncoding -> \"ASCII\"], \"SHA256\"], 16, 64];\ncurlyBExpr[data_Association] := If[data === <||>, 0, Total[KeyValueMap[#2 Times @@ ReleaseHold[#1] &, data]]];\ntestCurlyBCombine[left_Association, right_Association] := Module[{result = <||>, coeff, sign, key},\n  KeyValueMap[\n    Function[{leftModes, leftCoeff},\n      KeyValueMap[\n        Function[{rightModes, rightCoeff},\n          coeff = Wedge[leftCoeff, rightCoeff];\n          If[coeff =!= 0,\n            {sign, key} = Private`canonicalCurlyBKey[Join[ReleaseHold[leftModes], ReleaseHold[rightModes]]];\n            If[sign =!= 0, result[key] = Lookup[result, key, 0] + sign coeff]\n          ]\n        ],\n        right\n      ]\n    ],\n    left\n  ];\n  Select[result, # =!= 0 &]\n];\nbGhostModeCoeff[expr_, mode_] := Total[Cases[termList[Expand[expr]], coeff_. mode :> coeff]];\nholdInnerSignature[Private`BracketHold[args__]] := {\"Bracket\", holdArgSignature /@ {args}};\nholdArgSignature[Private`PropagatorHold[q_][Private`ProjectorBarHold[wH_, wA_][inner_]]] := {\"Propagator\", q, holdInnerSignature[inner]};\nholdArgSignature[field_] := field;\nholdTermSignature[Private`ProjectorHold[wH_, wA_][inner_]] := {\"Projector\", holdInnerSignature[inner]};\nholdSignatureSet[expr_] := Sort[ToString[InputForm[#]] & /@ (holdTermSignature /@ termList[expr])];\nholdSignatureHash[expr_] := IntegerString[Hash[ToString[InputForm[holdSignatureSet[expr]], CharacterEncoding -> \"ASCII\"], \"SHA256\"], 16, 64];\nvalidQSlotsQ[expr_] := Module[{terms = termList[expr], qs, expected},\n  And @@ (Function[term,\n      qs = Cases[term, Private`PropagatorHold[q_][_] :> q, Infinity];\n      expected = Table[ToExpression[\"q\" <> ToString[i]], {i, Length[qs]}];\n      Sort[DeleteDuplicates[qs]] === expected && Length[DeleteDuplicates[qs]] === Length[qs]\n    ] /@ terms)\n];\n\n{lch3, lca3, w3, wbar3, moduli3, rep3} = Private`getLocalCoordinateData[3];\nops3 = Private`placeOpAtPosGivenLocalCoordinates[lch3, lca3, {\n  R[c[0, w3], ct[0, wbar3]],\n  R[c[1, w3], ct[1, wbar3]],\n  R[c[0, w3], dXt[mu, 0, wbar3]]\n}];\nrawCurlyB1 = curlyBExpr[Private`createBs[ops3[[1]], lch3[[1]], lca3[[1]], 1, moduli3, w3, wbar3]];\nrawCurlyB2 = curlyBExpr[Private`createBs[ops3[[2]], lch3[[2]], lca3[[2]], 2, moduli3, w3, wbar3]];\nrawCurlyB3 = curlyBExpr[Private`createBs[ops3[[3]], lch3[[3]], lca3[[3]], 3, moduli3, w3, wbar3]];\nscaleH1 = Coefficient[Expand[lch3[[1]][w3] - lch3[[1]][0]], w3, 1];\nscaleA1 = Coefficient[Expand[lca3[[1]][wbar3] - lca3[[1]][0]], wbar3, 1];\nscaleH2 = Coefficient[Expand[lch3[[2]][w3] - lch3[[2]][0]], w3, 1];\nscaleA2 = Coefficient[Expand[lca3[[2]][wbar3] - lca3[[2]][0]], wbar3, 1];\nopListCurly = Private`placeOpAtPosGivenLocalCoordinates[lch3, lca3, {\n  R[c[0, w3], ct[0, wbar3]],\n  R[c[0, w3], ct[0, wbar3]],\n  R[c[0, w3], ct[0, wbar3]]\n}];\nsingleCurly = Private`createCurlyB[opListCurly, lch3, lca3, 3, moduli3, w3, wbar3];\ncurlyStructured = Private`createCurlyBs[singleCurly, Length[moduli3]];\ncurlyStructuredExpr = curlyBExpr[curlyStructured];\ncurlyApplied = Private`applyCurlyBs[opListCurly, curlyStructured, Length[moduli3]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Test 20: createBs coefficients for the first insertion\n\nPlaced `c`/`ct` operators should generate the expected `b_{-1}`/`b_0` and `\\!\\(\\*OverscriptBox[\\(b\\), \\(_\\)]\\)_{-1}`/`\\!\\(\\*OverscriptBox[\\(b\\), \\(_\\)]\\)_{0}` coefficients.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test20Result = And[\n  Simplify[bGhostModeCoeff[rawCurlyB1, Private`bmodeHolo[lch3[[1]][0]][-1][1]] + Differential[lch3[[1]][0], moduli3]] === 0,\n  Simplify[bGhostModeCoeff[rawCurlyB1, Private`bmodeHolo[lch3[[1]][0]][0][1]] + Differential[scaleH1, moduli3]/scaleH1] === 0,\n  Simplify[bGhostModeCoeff[rawCurlyB1, Private`bmodeAntiHolo[lca3[[1]][0]][-1][1]] + Differential[lca3[[1]][0], moduli3]] === 0,\n  Simplify[bGhostModeCoeff[rawCurlyB1, Private`bmodeAntiHolo[lca3[[1]][0]][0][1]] + Differential[scaleA1, moduli3]/scaleA1] === 0,\n  FreeQ[rawCurlyB1, Alternatives[Private`bmodeHolo[_][1][1], Private`bmodeAntiHolo[_][1][1]]]\n];\nPrint[\"Test 20 (createBs coefficients for insertion 1): \", If[test20Result, \"PASSED\", \"FAILED\"]];\ntest20Result",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Test 21: createBs coefficients for the second insertion\n\nA second placed ghost insertion should obey the same exact coefficient formulas with its own local-coordinate data.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test21Result = And[\n  Simplify[bGhostModeCoeff[rawCurlyB2, Private`bmodeHolo[lch3[[2]][0]][-1][2]] + Differential[lch3[[2]][0], moduli3]] === 0,\n  Simplify[bGhostModeCoeff[rawCurlyB2, Private`bmodeHolo[lch3[[2]][0]][0][2]] + Differential[scaleH2, moduli3]/scaleH2] === 0,\n  Simplify[bGhostModeCoeff[rawCurlyB2, Private`bmodeAntiHolo[lca3[[2]][0]][-1][2]] + Differential[lca3[[2]][0], moduli3]] === 0,\n  Simplify[bGhostModeCoeff[rawCurlyB2, Private`bmodeAntiHolo[lca3[[2]][0]][0][2]] + Differential[scaleA2, moduli3]/scaleA2] === 0,\n  FreeQ[rawCurlyB2, Alternatives[Private`bmodeHolo[_][1][2], Private`bmodeAntiHolo[_][1][2]]]\n];\nPrint[\"Test 21 (createBs coefficients for insertion 2): \", If[test21Result, \"PASSED\", \"FAILED\"]];\ntest21Result",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Test 22: createBs drops the missing chirality\n\nIf an insertion has no antiholomorphic `c`-ghost, the generated curly-B data should contain no antiholomorphic b-modes.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "rawCurlyB3String = ToString[InputForm[rawCurlyB3]];\ntest22Result = StringContainsQ[rawCurlyB3String, \"bmodeHolo\"] && !StringContainsQ[rawCurlyB3String, \"bmodeAntiHolo\"];\nPrint[\"Test 22 (createBs missing chirality stays zero): \", If[test22Result, \"PASSED\", \"FAILED\"]];\ntest22Result",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Test 23: structured curly-B combined expression hash\n\nThe combined curly-B expression should remain stable after the runtime trim.",
