   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
  "value": "test23Result = termHash[curlyStructuredExpr] === \"ef08430542b5a8e316fd2c42acd3d5025a7ff298695e8e039e47fa2155c94023\";\nPrint[\"Test 23 (structured curly-B expression hash): \", If[test23Result, \"PASSED\", \"FAILED\"]];\ntest23Result",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Test 24: applying structured curly-Bs matches the golden output\n\nApplying the trimmed curly-B representation should reproduce the same expanded multilocal operator.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
  "value": "test24Result = termHash[curlyApplied] === \"0f3da351b3193928014d40722c3ad08b80020cdc9228a71675752dfe939e3e12\";\nPrint[\"Test 24 (structured curly-B application hash): \", If[test24Result, \"PASSED\", \"FAILED\"]];\ntest24Result",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Test 25: structured combination is canonical and respects wedge antisymmetry\n\nCombining the trimmed association form should be order-independent and vanish when the differential wedge repeats.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "dupA = <|HoldComplete[{Private`bmodeHolo[zA][-1][1]}] -> Differential[s, {m}]|>;\ndupB = <|HoldComplete[{Private`bmodeHolo[zB][-1][2]}] -> Differential[s, {m}]|>;\nordC = <|HoldComplete[{Private`bmodeAntiHolo[zC][-1][3]}] -> Differential[t, {m}]|>;\ntest25Result = curlyBExpr[testCurlyBCombine[dupA, dupB]] === 0 && Simplify[Expand[curlyBExpr[testCurlyBCombine[dupA, ordC]] - curlyBExpr[testCurlyBCombine[ordC, dupA]]]] === 0;\nPrint[\"Test 25 (structured curly-B canonicalization and wedge antisymmetry): \", If[test25Result, \"PASSED\", \"FAILED\"]];\ntest25Result",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
